  <para style="h">1 Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikete rya mbere Pawulo yandikiye ab’i Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Te</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikete rya mbere Pawulo yandikiye ab’i</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Twebwe Pawulo, Silasi na Timoteyo,</para>
  <para style="po" vid="1TH 1:1">Turabandikiye, mwebwe abo mw’ishengero ry’i Tesalonike bari mu Mana Data no mu Mwami Yesu Kristo:</para>
  <para style="po" vid="1TH 1:1">Ubuntu n’amahoro bibane namwe.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gushima ukwizera kw’ab’i Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Twama dushima Imana ku bwanyu, kandi tubasengera ubudahumeka. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Iyo tubasengera ku Mana ari yo Data, twama twibuka ibikorwa vyanyu biva ku kwizera, ibikorwa vyanyu bisunitswe n’urukundo, hamwe rero n’ukwihangana kuva mu vyizigiro mufise mu Mwami wacu Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="1TH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Bene Data, bakundwa b’Imana, turazi neza ko Imana ibakunda, kandi ko yabatoranije, <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />kuko Ubutumwa Bwiza twabazaniye atari amajambo gusa, ariko bwarimwo ubushobozi, kuko Mpwemu Yera yabahaye ukwemezwa mu mitima ko ivyo twababwira kwari ukuri. Kandi murazi ingene twigenza muri mwebwe ku bwanyu. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Mwaratwiganye mwongera mwigana Umwami, kuko mwakiriye Ubutumwa n’umunezero uva kuri Mpwemu Yera, naho mwari mu mibabaro myinshi. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Ni co gituma mwabaye akarorero ku bandi bizera b’i Makedoniya no muri Akaya hose. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Ijambo ry’Umwami wacu ryarasamiranye riva iwanyu, ntiryashika i Makedoniya no muri Akaya gusa, ahubwo ukwizera Imana kwanyu kwaramenyekanye hose. Ni co gituma tutarinda kugira ico tubabwira ku vy’ukwo kwizera, <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />kuko na bo nyene ubwabo bama bavuga ukuntu mwatwakiriye neza, n’ukuntu mwahevye ibigirwamana mugahindukirira Imana nzima kandi y’ukuri. <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />Kandi baranavuga ukuntu mwiteganye igishika ukugaruka kw’Umwana w’Imana azoza avuye mw’ijuru, ari we Yesu, uwo Imana yazuye mu bapfuye. Ni we yadukijije uburake buzoza.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ingene Ubutumwa bwashitse i Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Bene Data, murazi neza ko ukubagendera kwacu kutabaye impfagusa. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Nk’uko mubizi, twari twabanje kubabarizwa twongera ducokorerwa i Filipi, ariko Imana iduha gushira ubwoba, tubabwira Ubutumwa Bwiza naho twariko turagwanywa bikomeye. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Kubatera intege kwacu ntikwavuye ku buzimire canke ku ntumbero mbi twari dufise, kandi ntitwarondera kubahenda. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Ariko, twabigisha kuko twemewe n’Imana ikaba kandi yatujeje kuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza. Ntituriko tugerageza kunezereza abantu, ariko dushaka kunezereza Imana, kuko ari yo isuzuma ivyiyumviro biri mu mitima yacu. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Murazi ko tutigeze na rimwe dukoresha amajambo yo kubaryosharyosha gusa, canke ngo tugerageze kwiyerekana uko tutari, twironderera amaronko. Imana ni yo cabona cacu. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Ntitwigeze na rimwe turondera guhabwa icubahiro n’abantu, baba mwebwe, canke uwundi muntu uwo ari we wese, naho kubera turi intumwa za Kristo twari twemerewe kugira ivyo tubasavye dukoresheje ububasha dufise. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Ahubwo, twicishije bugufi tumera nk’abana batoya muri mwebwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 2:7">Twari tumeze kurya kw’umuvyeyi ariko yitaho abana biwe. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Twarabakunze cane bituma tutababwira Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’Imana gusa, ahubwo twabahaye n’ubuzima bwacu na bwo. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Nta nkeka, bene Data, ko mwibuka uburuhe n’ukubabazwa vyacu; ingene twakora ijoro n’umurango kugira ngo ntihagire umuntu n’umwe turemera igihe twariko tubabwira Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’Imana. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Namwe muri ivyabona hamwe n’Imana, vy’ingene twigenza hagati yanyu, twejejwe, tugororotse kandi turi inyankamugayo rwose. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Murazi ingene twafata umwumwe wese muri mwebwe nk’uko umuvyeyi afata abana biwe. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Twarabatera intege, tukabaremesha, tukabahimiriza ngo mubeho ubuzima bubereye abantu b’Imana, yo yabahamagariye kuba mu Bwami bwayo n’ubwiza vyayo.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Turashima Imana kandi ko igihe mwakira ijambo ry’Imana mwatwumvanye, mutaryakiriye nk’amajambo asanzwe y’abantu, ariko mwaryakiriye nk’ijambo ry’Imana, nk’uko riri koko. Kandi iryo jambo ni ryo ribandanya gukorera muri mwebwe abizera. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Bene Data, namwe kubera mwemeye gufatira icitegererezo ku mashengero y’Imana ari i Yudaya arimwo abizera Yesu Kristo, ni co gituma muhamwa n’ab’iwanyu nk’uko ayo mashengero na yo yahamwe n’Abayuda, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />ari bo bishe Umwami Yesu n’abavugishwa, natwe bakatwangaza. Babaye igisesema ku Mana, bongera baba abansi b’abantu bose, <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />mu kugerageza kutubuza kwigisha Abanyamahanga kugira ngo bakizwe. Mu gukora ivyo, birundanijeko ivyaha. Nico gituma uburake bw’Imana bwabashitseko.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inkumbu za Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Ariko bene Data, tumaze gutandukana vy’akanya gato (ku bw’imibiri atari ku bw’imitima), twakoze uko dushoboye kwose kugira ngo tugaruke kubagendera kuko twari tubakumbuye cane. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Twaripfuje kuza iwanyu, kandi jewe Pawulo navyipfuje kenshi, ariko Satani aradutangira. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Mbega ikidutera ivyizigiro n’umunezero canke igitsibo tuzokwirata imbere y’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo igihe azozira ni ikihe? Si mwebwe? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Ni ivy’ukuri, muri ubwiza n’umunezero vyacu.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Ariko tubonye tutagishoboye kwihanganira kutamenya amakuru yanyu, twahisemwo gusigara twenyene muri Atenayi, <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />duca tubarungikira Timoteyo ngo abagendere. Ni mwene Data akorera Imana hamwe natwe mu kuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza bwa Kristo. Tumurungitse kugira ngo abakomeze, yongere abaremeshe mu kwizera kwanyu, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />maze ntimunyiganyizwe n’ibibagerageza. Ariko murazi neza ko ivyo biri mu vyo twateguriwe. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />N’igihe twari kumwe namwe, twamye tubaburira ko dushobora guhamwa, kandi vyabaye uko nyene nk’uko na mwebwe mubizi neza. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Ni co gituma rero, kuko ntari ngishoboye kuvyihanganira, naciye ndungika Timoteyo kugira ngo nshobore kumenya ko ukwizera kwanyu kwoba kugikomeye. Nari mfise ubwoba ko wa mugeragezi yoba yarabagerageje, maze igikorwa cacu muri mwebwe kikaba cabaye impfagusa.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amakuru meza ya Timoteyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Ubu rero Timoteyo aherutse kugaruka avuye iwanyu, kandi yatuzaniye inkuru nziza y’ukwizera n’urukundo vyanyu. Yatubwiye ko mugira umunezero iyo mutwibutse, kandi ko mwipfuza gusubira kutubona nk’uko natwe twipfuza gusubira kubabona. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />None rero bene Data, mu mibabaro n’ihamwa vyacu, turaremeshwa n’ukwo kwizera kwanyu. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Kumenya ko muhagaze mutanyiganyiga mu Mwami bisubiza intege mu buzima bwacu. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Mbega ni gute twoshimira Imana bikwiye umunezero dufise ku bwanyu? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Dusenga ubudahumeka ijoro n’umurango, kugira ngo bikunde tugaruke iwanyu tubafashishe ivyo muhajije mu kwizera kwanyu.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Imana yo nyene ari yo Data, n’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo, baducire inzira kugira ngo dushobore kuzobagendera vuba. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Kandi dusenga ngo Imana yongereze kandi isesekaze urukundo mugiriranira hagati yanyu, n’abandi bose, nk’uko urwacu rumeze kuri mwebwe. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Imana ikomeze imitima yanyu kugira ngo muzosangwe mutagira agasembwa, muri abera imbere y’Imana yacu ari yo Data wa twese, aho Umwami wacu Yesu azogarukira azananye n’abera biwe. Amen.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kubaho tunezereza Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Bene Data, twarababwiye uko mukwiye kwigenza kugira ngo munezereze Imana, kanatsinda ni ko mubayeho. Ubu naho turabasaba tubinginga mw’izina ry’Umwami Yesu ngo murushirize. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Kuko murazi ivyo twabigishije turi mu bubasha bw’Umwami Yesu.<verse eid="1TH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Ico Imana igomba ni uko mubaho mwejejwe, muri kure y’ivyaha vy’ubusambanyi. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Kandi ni uko umwe wese muri mwebwe abaho aganza umubiri wiwe, yejejwe kandi yihesha agateka, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />mudatwarwa n’ivyipfuzo vy’umubiri nk’abapagani batazi Imana. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Kandi muri ivyo vyose, ntihakagire uwugirira nabi mwene Se canke ngo amugunge, kuko Umwami azohana ivyaha nk’ivyo vyose nk’uko twari tumaze kubibabwira no kubibaburirako. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Imana ntiyaduhamagariye kuba abahumanye, ariko ishaka ko tugira ubuzima bwejejwe. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Ni co gituma uwanse kugendera izi nyigisho ataba yanse umuntu, ariko aba yanse Imana, yo ibaha Mpwemu wayo Yera.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Naho ku bijanye n’urukundo mu bavukana, ntitwokwirirwa turabibandikirako vyinshi, kuko Imana yo nyene yabiyigishirije ingene mukwiye gukundana. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Kandi ni ko biri, urwo rukundo mwararwerekanye kuri bene Data bose b’i Makedoniya. Bene Data, turabinginga, ngo murushirizeho kwerekana urukundo nk’urwo. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Mugire ishaka ryo kubaho ubuzima butekanye; umwe wese yiteho gukora ibimwerekeye kandi ajejwe, no gukoresha amaboko yiwe nk’uko twabibabwiye. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Kubaho kwanyu gutyo mu buzima bwa misi yose, bizotuma abo hanze batizera babubaha, kandi mwidegemvye imbere y’umuntu wese.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyo kuzuka kw’abapfuye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Bene Data, turashaka ko mumenya ibizoba ku bapfuye bizeye, kugira ngo ntimwicwe n’umubabaro nk’abadafise ivyizigiro. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Uko twizera ko Yesu yapfuye hanyuma akazuka, ni ko twizera ko Imana imugarukanye azoza azananye n’abasinziriye bari muri we. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Dufatiye kw’Ijambo Umwami yivugiye, turababwiye ko natwe abazoba bakiri bazima, dusigaye gushika ku kugaruka kw’Umwami, tutazotanga abamaze gupfa kumusanganira. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Kuko, Umwami wacu ubwiwe azomanuka avuye mw’ijuru, azotegeka n’ijwi rirenga, hamwe n’akamo k’umumarayika mukuru n’uguhamagara kw’inzamba y’Imana, maze abapfiriye muri Kristo bazoca bazuka ubwa mbere. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Hanyuma, natwe abazoba bakiriho, tuzoca tuduganwa mu bicu, dusanganire Umwami mu kirere. Ni ho tuzoca tubana n’Umwami ibihe bitazoshira. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Nuko muremeshanye n’ayo majambo.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Kugaruka kw’Umwami wacu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Bene Data, ku vyerekeye imisi n’ibihe ivyo bizoshikirako, ntitwari dukwiye no kurinda kubibandikira, <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />kuko musanzwe muzi neza ko umusi Umwami wacu azogarukirako uzoshika nk’igisuma mw’ijoro. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Igihe abantu bazoba bavuga bati: “Ni amahoro, nta nkomanzi,” ni ho ugutikizwa kuzobashikako giturumbuka, kurya umugore yibungenze afatwa n’ibise, kandi nta wuzorokoka.<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Ariko mweho bene Data, kuko mutari mu mwijima, uwo musi ntuzobashikako giturumbuka nk’igisuma. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Mwese muri abana b’umuco n’abana b’umurango. Ntituri ab’ijoro, kandi ntituri ab’umwijima. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Ni co gituma tudakwiye kwifata nk’abandi basinziriye. Twame turi maso, twirinde akaborerwe. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Kuko abaryama baryama mw’ijoro, kandi n’ababorerwa baborerwa mw’ijoro. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Ariko ko turi ab’umurango, muze tugendane ubwenge, twambaye ukwizera n’urukundo nk’icuma gikingira igikiriza, n’ivyizigiro vy’agakiza nk’inkofero y’icuma. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Kuko Imana itadushiriyeho kuzorakirwa na yo, ariko yadushiriyeho kuronka agakiza mu Mwami wacu Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Yaradupfiriye kugira ngo ni yaza, nimba tuzoba twarapfuye canke nimba tuzoba tukiriho, tuzobane na we ibihe vyose. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />None rero muremeshanye mwongere mukomezanye, nk’uko musanzwe muriko murabikora.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Impanuro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Bene Data, turabinginze ngo mwubahe abakorera muri mwebwe, babarongoye mu gikorwa c’Umwami, kandi babarongora mu vy’Impwemu. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Mububahe n’imitima yanyu yose kandi mubakunda kubera igikorwa cabo. Mubane amahoro. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Kandi, turabinginze bene Data ngo muhanure ibinebwe, muremeshe abadendebukiwe, mufashe abanyantegenke, mwihanganirane. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Mwirinde ntihagire uwusubiza inabi mugenziwe, ahubwo mwame murondera kugiriranira ineza hagati yanyu no ku bandi.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Mwame munezerewe ibihe vyose <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Musenge ubudahumeka. <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Mwame mushima Imana mu bibashikira vyose kuko ari vyo Imana ibashakako mwebwe abari muri Kristo Yesu.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Ntimukazimye Mpwemu Yera. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />Ntimugakengere ubuvugishwa, <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />ahubwo musuzume vyose, hanyuma mugumye ivyiza. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Mwirinde ikibi cose.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Imana yo nyene, yo Mana y’amahoro, ibandanye ibeza; kandi impwemu, imishaha n’imibiri vyanyu bizosangwe bitagira agasembwa ku musi w’ukuza kw’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Iyabahamagaye ni iyo kwizigirwa, no kubishitsa izobishitsa.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Bene Data, mudusengere.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Muturamukirize bene Data bose n’ukugumbirana kwera.<verse eid="1TH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Ndabasavye ndi imbere y’Umwami wacu ngo iri kete rizosomerwe bene Data bose.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Ubuntu bw’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo bubane namwe.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
